<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-pound (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective July 10 to 16:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 66.42</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 70.74</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 72.73</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 76.38</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$180.53</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$135.40</p>
<p>    Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 99.53</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 25.89</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.59</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 28.55</p>
</text>
